<title>USA: Cullen/Frost to acquire Corpus Christi.</title>
<headline>Cullen/Frost to acquire Corpus Christi.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO, Texas 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cullen/Frost Bankers Inc said on Monday that it has entered into a definitive agreement to acquire Corpus Christi Bancshares Inc for $18.84 per share, or $33 million, assuming the exercise of all outstanding options.</p>
<p>Cullen/Frost said it expects the acquisition to be immediately accretive to its earnings. As of June 30, 1996, Corpus Christi had assets of $207 million.</p>
<p>Cullen/Frost's assets were $4.5 billion at June 30.</p>
</text>
